1
00:00:00,563 --> 00:00:01,723
(Bernadette:)You okay?

2
00:00:01,898 --> 00:00:03,388
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

3
00:00:04,734 --> 00:00:06,104
(Howard:)I'm terrific.

4
00:00:07,437 --> 00:00:09,337
So?

5
00:00:12,409 --> 00:00:14,669
(Leonard:)Which one do you think it is...

6
00:00:15,245 --> 00:00:16,715
(Leonard:)...matey?

7
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:22,046
Actually, I don't wanna know.

8
00:00:22,218 --> 00:00:25,948
(Howard:)I want all of them to be true.

9
00:00:26,122 --> 00:00:27,352
(Leonard:)Well, one of them is.

10
00:00:27,524 --> 00:00:29,394
(Howard:)That's pretty cool.

11
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,690
(Howard:)Thank you, guys.

12
00:00:32,262 --> 00:00:35,232
(Penny:)Hey, it's still early.
Why don't we go back and have that party?

13
00:00:35,398 --> 00:00:37,268
(Sheldon:)- Yeah.
- Okay.

14
00:00:39,369 --> 00:00:40,599
Yeah, surprisingly...

15
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:44,430
(Sheldon:)...the letter from your father wasn't
the most interesting thing in the closet.

16
00:00:44,607 --> 00:00:47,697
(Sheldon:)Bernadette's diary
has some saucy passages.

17
00:00:48,411 --> 00:00:51,571
- Sheldon, don't you dare.
- Nothing to worry about.

18
00:00:51,748 --> 00:00:53,308
(Sheldon:)Your secret's safe with me.

19
00:00:53,483 --> 00:00:56,023
(Bernadette:)That's more like it.

